<title>CHINA: Korea Long Term sets US$150 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Korea Long Term sets US$150 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger BT Asia on Wednesday.</p>
<p>BORROWER KOREA LONG TERM CREDIT BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$150 MLN  COUPON 6ML+40(YR1), 47BP(YR2), 51BP(YR3)</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> PUTS     ANNUAL	CALLS	NONE	LAUNCHED  09.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING  LONDON	REPAYMENT  BULLET    REPLIES   18.JUL.97</p>
<p> RATING   --	    SALES LMTS STANDARD  DENOMS  $10K, $100K</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	   CRS DEF    YES	 FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH     HOME CTRY  S.KOREA   PAY DATE  25.JUL.97</p>
<p> TOTAL FEE 3 BP</p>
<p> ARRANGERS  BT ASIA, CREDIT LYONNAIS AND KDB ASIA</p>
<p> NOTES     *THE ISSUER IS RATED A3 BY MOODY'S INVESTORS SERVICE</p>
<p>	     AND A-MINUS BY STANDARD AND POOR'S. THE NOTES ARE</p>
<p>	     ISSUED OFF THE BORROWER'S US$2 BILLION EMTN</p>
<p>	     PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
